#api call for register a user
###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/accounts/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username":"sanju",
    "email":"sanju1@gmail.com",
    "password":"sanju@123",
    "phone":809396922
}

#api call for token
###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/accounts/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username":"sanju",
    "password":"sanju@123"
}

#api call for retrieve logged-in user profile
###
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/accounts/profile/
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Token 73960eba92903c6d3e4e0277584f62fc06d08325


